        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eminem, Rihanna, Destinee & Paris\n- Songs: \"The Monster\", \"Love the Way You Lie\", \"Love the Way You Lie (Part II)\", \"What's My Name?\"\n- Albums: Loud\n- Concepts: collaborations, influences\n\nFacts:\n- \"Loud\" was Rihanna's fifth album.\n- \"What's My Name?\" was a song from Rihanna's album \"Loud.\"\n- \"The Monster\" marked the fourth collaboration between Eminem and Rihanna.\n- \"The Monster\" followed earlier Eminem collaborations with Rihanna, including \"Love the Way You Lie\" and Rihanna's sequel \"Love the Way You Lie (Part II).\"\n- A performance of \"The Monster\" was part of a medley that included Rihanna's song \"What's My Name?\"\n- Destinee & Paris cited Rihanna as an influence.",
